  "reasoning": "The defendant Qin manufactured and sold counterfeit leather bags bearing the registered trademark “ISSEYMIYAKE” without the trademark owner's permission, and also supplied materials for further counterfeit production. This conduct constitutes the crime of infringing a registered trademark’s exclusive rights under Chinese criminal law (Article 210). No other listed companion charges (信用卡诈骗, 票据诈骗) apply to the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[侵犯注册商标专用权罪]"
}
